- `packages/plugins/plugin-audit/README.md:3`, which ships to npm;
- `src/index.ts:7`;
- the comments at `src/audit-writers.ts:223` and `:251`;
- the hand-written `sys_audit_log.description` leaf in the 10 translation locales: ar, de, es-ES, fr, ja-JP, ko, pt-BR, ru, zh-CN, zh-Hant. Merge mode does not rewrite an existing translation, and AGENTS.md allows hand edits to translation values.
`en.objects.generated.ts` is regenerated with `node scripts/check-i18n-bundles.mjs --write`. `content/docs` is unchanged: `objects.mdx:275` describes the append-only bucket, not this object, and the PR notes it.
